243
00:13:59,724 --> 00:14:03,873
TST-001 · Ship a harness: the library's testing API

244
00:14:04,998 --> 00:14:08,087
Product teams should never query the library's internal DOM.

245
00:14:08,087 --> 00:14:12,548
A component harness is a supported, versioned testing API: it hides the markup,

246
00:14:12,548 --> 00:14:17,354
works in unit tests and end-to-end tests, and waits for the component to be

247
00:14:17,354 --> 00:14:17,697
stable.

248
00:14:17,697 --> 00:14:19,756
When the library changes its markup,

249
00:14:19,756 --> 00:14:22,502
it updates its own harness, and consumers' tests

250
00:14:22,502 --> 00:14:23,189
